&lt;li&gt;Proficient to expert capability in Account Management and Project Management, with confidence running several complex projects at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside video and photography producers as part of a joined-up approach to campaign delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with project scheduling and sourcing resource and production services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client engagement skills, with the ability to organise, influence and build effective working relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, courteous communication across strategy, creative, production and client teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close attention to detail, sound commercial awareness and a sharp eye for project risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort integrating with a client-side team while maintaining a top-tier agency service.&lt;/li&gt;
